# WindowControls: decorations on, a foot window. Check in each look.
# MANUAL: decorations must be on (config); the maximise control position depends on the window placement - read it from the shot
setup foot &
wait 2
shot window
note A foot window with decorations; the maximise control (green/right of the title bar) is where the next pointer paths go. Same as QML.
# NOTE: positions assumed: foot opens tiled; adjust from the shot.
ptr move 960 540 sleep 300 glide 1860 20 300 sleep 600
shot maxgrid
note Hovering the maximise control and waiting opens the tile grid (snap zones); same as QML.
ptr glide 960 700 300 sleep 300
shot maxgrid-away
note After gliding away the tile grid is closed (same as QML).
ptr move 960 540 sleep 300 glide 1860 20 300 sleep 2000
shot maxgrid-timeout
note Not coming back over it for 1.5 s: the grid closes by itself (same as QML).
# MANUAL: click the left-half zone of the tile grid -> the window takes the left half
# MANUAL: Material: press down on close and hold without releasing over it -> corners go to 8 in 150 ms; glide off, then up
